{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54739","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 二十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金与月，俱出在西方。\n星北北方军必胜，星南南面将身（辛本、川本作「星」）强，月白（辛本、川本作「向」）将兵亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}